CuBit firmware
==============

Unmodified files from linux-firmware
(https://gitlab.com/kernel-firmware/linux-firmware), laid out as upstream
lays them out, so this directory can become its own repository or be
replaced by upstream without path changes. Drivers embed these files at
build time: a component's `embedded` blob names the file and its SHA-256
((Source.Vendored "firmware/<path>" sha256)), and ccl-build refuses bytes
that do not match (docs/device-matching.md, "Firmware").

Upstream URL of each file:
https://gitlab.com/kernel-firmware/linux-firmware/-/raw/<tag>/<upstream path>

